1	<!DOCTYPE html>
2	<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
3	<head>
4		<meta charset="utf-8">
5		<meta http-equiv="content-security-policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
6		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
7		<meta name="description" content="A well-structured, accessible HTML5 document with modern best practices.">
8		<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
9		<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
10		<meta name="theme-color" content="#121212" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
11		<title>Welcome</title>
12		<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Ctext y='.9em' font-size='90'%3E👋%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
13		<style>
14			:root {
15				color-scheme: light dark;
16				--text: #1a1a1a;
17				--text-secondary: #555;
18				--background: #fff;
19				--surface: #fff;
20				--accent: #0052a3;
21				--border: #e0e0e0;
22			}
23			@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
24				:root {
25					--text: #e0e0e0;
26					--text-secondary: #a0a0a0;
27					--background: #121212;
28					--surface: #1e1e1e;
29					--accent: #5fa3ff;
30					--border: #333;
31				}
32			}
33			*,
34			*::before,
35			*::after {
36				box-sizing: border-box;
37			}
38			html {
39				-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
40				text-size-adjust: 100%;
41			}
42			@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
43				html {
44					scroll-behavior: smooth;
45				}
46				a {
47					transition: text-decoration-thickness 0.15s ease;
48				}
49				.skip-link {
50					transition: transform 0.15s ease;
51				}
52				button,
53				.button {
54					transition: opacity 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
55				}
56			}
57			body {
58				display: grid;
59				grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
60				grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
61				min-height: 100vh;
62				min-height: 100dvh;
63				font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
64				font-size: 1rem;
65				line-height: 1.6;
66				overflow-wrap: break-word;
67				max-width: 70ch;
68				margin: 0 auto;
69				padding-top: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-top));
70				padding-right: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-right));
71				padding-bottom: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
72				padding-left: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-left));
73				color: var(--text);
74				background: var(--background);
75			}
76			h1 {
77				color: var(--accent);
78				font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.25rem + 3vw, 2.5rem);
79				font-weight: 700;
80				line-height: 1.1;
81				text-wrap: balance;
82				margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
83				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
84			}
85			h2 {
86				color: var(--accent);
87				font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1.5vw, 1.75rem);
88				font-weight: 600;
89				line-height: 1.2;
90				text-wrap: balance;
91				margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;
92				letter-spacing: -0.01em;
93			}
94			h2:first-child {
95				margin-top: 0;
96			}
97			p {
98				text-wrap: pretty;
99				margin: 1rem 0;
100				line-height: 1.65;
101			}
102			a {
103				color: var(--accent);
104				text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
105				text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
106				text-decoration-skip-ink: auto;
107				font-weight: 500;
108			}
109			a:hover, a:active {
110				text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
111			}
112			button,
113			.button {
114				display: inline-block;
115				text-decoration: none;
116				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
117				font-size: 1rem;
118				font-weight: 500;
119				font-family: inherit;
120				color: var(--background);
121				background: var(--accent);
122				border: 2px solid var(--accent);
123				border-radius: 0.25rem;
124				cursor: pointer;
125				white-space: nowrap;
126			}
127			button:hover,
128			.button:hover {
129				opacity: 0.85;
130				text-decoration: none;
131			}
132			button:active,
133			.button:active {
134				transform: scale(0.97);
135			}
136			ul, ol {
137				margin: 1rem 0;
138				padding-left: 2rem;
139			}
140			li {
141				margin: 0.5rem 0;
142			}
143			:focus-visible {
144				outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
145				outline-offset: 2px;
146			}
147			a:not(.button):focus-visible {
148				border-radius: 2px;
149			}
150			.skip-link {
151				position: absolute;
152				left: 0;
153				top: 0;
154				transform: translateY(-100%);
155				background: var(--accent);
156				color: var(--background);
157				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
158				z-index: 1000;
159				border-radius: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
160				font-weight: 600;
161				text-decoration: none;
162				display: inline-block;
163			}
164			.skip-link:focus {
165				transform: none;
166				outline: 3px solid var(--text);
167				outline-offset: -3px;
168			}
169			header {
170				padding-block: 1.5rem 0;
171			}
172			header nav ul {
173				display: flex;
174				flex-wrap: wrap;
175				gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
176				margin: 1rem 0 0 0;
177				padding: 0;
178				list-style: none;
179			}
180			header nav li {
181				margin: 0;
182			}
183			main {
184				padding: 1rem 0;
185			}
186			main:focus {
187				outline: none;
188			}
189			section {
190				margin: 2rem 0;
191				scroll-margin-top: 1.5rem;
192			}
193			@media (forced-colors: active) {
194				.skip-link,
195				button,
196				.button {
197					border: 2px solid ButtonText;
198				}
199			}
200			.card {
201				border: 1px solid var(--border);
202				border-radius: 0.5rem;
203				padding: 1.5rem;
204				background: var(--surface);
205				margin: 1.5rem 0;
206			}
207			.card h3 {
208				font-size: 1.25rem;
209				line-height: 1.3;
210				text-wrap: balance;
211				margin-top: 0;
212				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
213				color: var(--accent);
214			}
215			.visually-hidden {
216				position: absolute;
217				width: 1px;
218				height: 1px;
219				margin: -1px;
220				padding: 0;
221				overflow: hidden;
222				clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
223				white-space: nowrap;
224				border: 0;
225			}
226			@media (prefers-contrast: more) {
227				:root {
228					--border: currentColor;
229				}
230				button,
231				.button {
232					border-width: 3px;
233				}
234				.card {
235					border-width: 2px;
236				}
237			}
238			footer {
239				padding-block: 1.5rem;
240				border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
241				font-size: 0.875rem;
242				color: var(--text-secondary);
243				text-align: center;
244			}
245			footer p {
246				margin: 0.5rem 0;
247			}
248			small {
249				display: block;
250			}
251			@media print {
252				:root {
253					color-scheme: light;
254					--text: #000;
255					--text-secondary: #333;
256					--background: #fff;
257					--surface: #fff;
258					--accent: #000;
259					--border: #999;
260				}
261				.skip-link,
262				button,
263				.button {
264					display: none;
265				}
266				body {
267					display: block;
268					min-height: 0;
269					max-width: none;
270					padding: 0;
271				}
272				a {
273					color: inherit;
274					text-decoration: underline;
275				}
276				a[href^="http"]::after {
277					content: " (" attr(href) ")";
278					font-size: 0.85em;
279					font-weight: normal;
280				}
281				.card {
282					border: none;
283					break-inside: avoid;
284				}
285			}
286		</style>
287	</head>
288	<body>
289		<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
290		<header>
291			<h1>Welcome</h1>
292			<nav aria-label="Page sections">
293				<ul>
294					<li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
295					<li><a href="#examples">Examples</a></li>
296					<li><a href="#resources">Resources</a></li>
297				</ul>
298			</nav>
299		</header>
300		<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
301			<section aria-label="Introduction">
302				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
303				<p>
304					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
305					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
306				</p>
307				<p>
308					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
309					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
310				</p>
311			</section>
312	
313			<section aria-labelledby="features">
314				<h2 id="features">Features</h2>
315				<ul>
316					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
317					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
318					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
319					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
320					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
321					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
322				</ul>
323			</section>
324	
325			<section aria-labelledby="examples">
326				<h2 id="examples">Examples</h2>
327				<article class="card">
328					<h3>Component Cards</h3>
329					<p>Card components are useful for organizing related content. They include a subtle border and padding for visual separation.</p>
330					<a class="button" href="#resources">Learn more<span class="visually-hidden"> about accessibility resources</span></a>
331				</article>
332	
333				<article class="card">
334					<h3>Interactive Elements</h3>
335					<p>Buttons and links are fully accessible with clear focus states. The “Learn more” button above demonstrates smooth transitions and proper visual feedback.</p>
336					<p>Try using the Tab key to navigate through all interactive elements.</p>
337				</article>
338			</section>
339	
340			<section aria-labelledby="resources">
341				<h2 id="resources">Resources</h2>
342				<p>Want to learn more about web accessibility and semantic HTML? Check out these resources:</p>
343				<ul>
344					<li><a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/quickref/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WCAG 2.2 Quick Reference<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></li>
345					<li><a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HTML Living Standard<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></li>
346					<li><a href="https://www.a11y-101.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">A11y 101<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in new tab)</span></a></li>
347				</ul>
348			</section>
349		</main>
350		<footer>
351			<p><small>&copy; <time datetime="2026">2026</time>. All rights reserved.</small></p>
352			<p><a href="#main">Back to top</a></p>
353		</footer>
354	</body>
355	</html>
